Lughnasadh NEWS — history of user-visible changes
=================================================

* Version 0.3.0 (Third Harvest)
  Aspiration windows, check extension, bishop-pair evaluation.
  Documentation tree aligned with free-software / GNU-style layout.

* Version 0.2.0 (Second Harvest)
  Bitboards, iterative deepening, TT, null-move, LMR, quiescence, tapered eval.

* Version 0.1.0 (First Harvest)
  Initial UCI classical engine for study and prep.
